abstract: >-
  Research software for dermoscopic skin-lesion classification and melanoma
  endpoint evaluation. The source release includes OncoDerm-MambaX model code,
  experiment configurations, data preparation and evaluation scripts, fixed
  image-ID partitions, and selected aggregate figure data with rendering scripts.
